    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107150/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1724952966\" /></div><br><br>All characters in this game are 18 or older.<br><br>\u25cfGame Overview<br>If the mission fails, the endless &quot;nightmare&quot; awaits...<br>Infiltrate an evil corporation to take down the bad guys!<br><br>\u25cfPlot<br>&quot;Saionji Kaori&quot; is a spy that works for an intelligence agency.<br>She was a young and talented spy, helping to make the world a better place.<br>&quot;Justice&quot; was her calling.<br>And she also had another mission, to find her missing &quot;friend&quot;.<br>\u3000<br>One day, she gets some intel on her friend, but then...<br><br><br>\u25cf &quot;Kaori Saionji&quot;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107150/extras/2e283aa1f676f3f4f51cfab4af5b7ca2.avif?t=1724952966\" /></div><br><br>\u25cfGame system<br>- Easy gameplay! No combat, explore-only RPG!<br>-Infiltrate evil corporations, collect evidence, and take down the &quot;mastermind&quot;!<br>-But infiltrating an evil corporation comes with a risk.<br>If she fails, the bad guys will come after her relentlessly...<br>-Play time<br>2 - 3 hours<br>*You can unlock all CGs within the first hour.<br>-Recollection room available<br>Finish the game to unlock all scenes<br>-No grotesque scenes, no blood.<br><br><br>Make one mistake and she'll be caught!<br>If she takes too long or fall for a trap...<br>She'll be taken in for questioning... Then...<br><br>If she gets caught, there's no way out...!<br>Will she succeed and come out on top, or fail miserably? Only time will tell...",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107150/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1724952966\" /></div><br><br>All characters in this game are 18 or older.<br><br>\u25cfGame Overview<br>If the mission fails, the endless &quot;nightmare&quot; awaits...<br>Infiltrate an evil corporation to take down the bad guys!<br><br>\u25cfPlot<br>&quot;Saionji Kaori&quot; is a spy that works for an intelligence agency.<br>She was a young and talented spy, helping to make the world a better place.<br>&quot;Justice&quot; was her calling.<br>And she also had another mission, to find her missing &quot;friend&quot;.<br>\u3000<br>One day, she gets some intel on her friend, but then...<br><br><br>\u25cf &quot;Kaori Saionji&quot;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107150/extras/2e283aa1f676f3f4f51cfab4af5b7ca2.avif?t=1724952966\" /></div><br><br>\u25cfGame system<br>- Easy gameplay! No combat, explore-only RPG!<br>-Infiltrate evil corporations, collect evidence, and take down the &quot;mastermind&quot;!<br>-But infiltrating an evil corporation comes with a risk.<br>If she fails, the bad guys will come after her relentlessly...<br>-Play time<br>2 - 3 hours<br>*You can unlock all CGs within the first hour.<br>-Recollection room available<br>Finish the game to unlock all scenes<br>-No grotesque scenes, no blood.<br><br><br>Make one mistake and she'll be caught!<br>If she takes too long or fall for a trap...<br>She'll be taken in for questioning... Then...<br><br>If she gets caught, there's no way out...!<br>Will she succeed and come out on top, or fail miserably? Only time will tell...",
